---
import Layout from "@layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="About | Radical Data">
  <main class="about-page">
    <section class="wrapper about-hero">
      <p class="about-kicker">About</p>
      <h1>Technology for liberation and joy.</h1>
      <p class="about-intro">
        Radical Data is a collective that creates technology for liberation and joy.
        Bringing together practices from data science, socially engaged art and Latin
        American activism, we build community-based projects that redefine the role of
        technology in our present and future.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="wrapper about-section">
      <div class="about-section-heading">
        <p class="about-kicker">Our vision</p>
        <h2>We start from the people usually excluded from designing technology.</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="about-copy flow">
        <p>
          Our work starts with the people usually left out of designing technology,
          even though they live with its consequences every day. People whose
          knowledge is embodied, local, political and routinely ignored by mainstream
          tech.
        </p>
        <p>
          We create spaces to learn, build, argue, imagine and break things together.
          That means workshops, collective prototypes, artistic experiments and tools
          shaped with communities from the ground up. Spaces where people shape
          technology instead of being managed by it.
        </p>
        <p>
          Our projects experiment with different technological paradigms: tools for
          collective life, not billionaire fantasies; infrastructures that serve
          people, not platforms that extract from them.
        </p>
        <p>
          We build and test radical utopias together, reimagining what technology can
          do in the present and what kind of future it can help us make.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="wrapper about-section">
      <div class="about-section-heading">
        <p class="about-kicker">Our lines of work</p>
        <h2>Three ways our practice takes shape.</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="work-grid">
        <article class="work-card work-card--yellow">
          <p class="work-card__kicker">Line of work</p>
          <h3>Tools for Postcapitalism</h3>
          <p>
            We design and prototype tools that make different economic relations
            possible: tools for cooperation, shared resources and collective
            abundance beyond extraction, scarcity and competition.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="work-card work-card--red">
          <p class="work-card__kicker">Line of work</p>
          <h3>Collective Intelligence</h3>
          <p>
            We build systems that help people think, decide and act together. We
            bring different forms of knowledge into the same space: lived,
            technical, embodied, human and more-than-human.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="work-card work-card--blue">
          <p class="work-card__kicker">Line of work</p>
          <h3>Tecnología Popular</h3>
          <p>
            We develop community-centred technology practices through education,
            experimentation and shared learning. For us, technology is not
            something to passively consume. It is something people can understand,
            shape and own together.
          </p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="wrapper about-section">
      <div class="about-section-heading">
        <p class="about-kicker">Our team</p>
        <h2>People shaping Radical Data.</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="team-grid">
        <article class="team-card flow">
          <div>
            <p class="team-card__role">Founder</p>
            <h3>Rayén Jara Mitrovich</h3>
          </div>
          <p>
            Rayén is a Chilean artist, activist and researcher whose work focuses
            on intimacy, bodies and their interaction with technology. After ten
            years of working on art projects with communities — including
            Indigenous communities living in isolated areas of Chile, young people
            in jail, children in social shelters and women who have experienced
            violence — Rayén co-founded Radical Data to explore the potential of
            technology for connection and intimacy.
          </p>
          <p>
            <a href="http://rayenjaramitrovich.com" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">
              rayenjaramitrovich.com
            </a>
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="team-card flow">
          <div>
            <p class="team-card__role">Founder</p>
            <h3>Jo Jara Kroese</h3>
          </div>
          <p>
            Jo is an English-Dutch mathematician, artist and technologist. Their
            work uses data and technology to create tools for resistance and real
            utopias. As the co-founder of Radical Data, they have built tools for
            anti-fascism, worked as a political consultant for socialists in Latin
            America, and made an AI that learns to be thankful.
          </p>
          <p>
            <a href="http://jokroese.com" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">
              jokroese.com
            </a>
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="team-card flow">
          <div>
            <p class="team-card__role">Coordination and Communication</p>
            <h3>Ágata Bañón</h3>
          </div>
          <p>
            Ágata is a Spanish artist and organiser working at the intersection of
            gender, technology and collective imagination. With a strong
            background in communications across public and private sectors, as
            well as grassroots social activism, she collaborates with Radical Data
            to strengthen organisational strategy and communications.
          </p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>

<style>
  .about-page {
    --about-paper: #f3f0e8;
    --about-ink: #111;
    --about-border: #111;
    --about-shadow: 0.35rem 0.35rem 0 var(--about-border);
    --about-yellow: #ffe500;
    --about-red: #ff5b4d;
    --about-blue: #204cff;
    --about-font: Inter, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system,
      BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", sans-serif;

    background: var(--about-paper);
    color: var(--about-ink);
    font-family: var(--about-font);
  }

  .about-page :global(h1),
  .about-page :global(h2),
  .about-page :global(h3),
  .about-page :global(p),
  .about-page :global(a),
  .about-page :global(li),
  .about-page :global(input),
  .about-page :global(button) {
    font-family: var(--about-font);
  }

  .about-hero {
    padding-top: clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 5rem);
    padding-bottom: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 4rem);
  }

  .about-kicker {
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    font-weight: 900;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: rgb(17 17 17 / 0.72);
  }

  .about-hero h1,
  .about-section-heading h2 {
    font-weight: 900;
    letter-spacing: -0.04em;
    line-height: 0.92;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    max-width: 14ch;
  }

  .about-hero h1 {
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
    font-size: clamp(3rem, 9vw, 7rem);
  }

  .about-intro {
    margin-top: 1.25rem;
    max-width: 38rem;
    font-size: clamp(1.12rem, 2vw, 1.5rem);
    line-height: 1.12;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .about-section {
    padding-block: clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 5rem);
    border-top: 2px solid var(--about-border);
  }

  .about-section-heading {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.55rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .about-section-heading h2 {
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 4.25rem);
  }

  .about-copy {
    max-width: 48rem;
  }

  .about-copy p {
    font-size: clamp(1rem, 1.5vw, 1.15rem);
    line-height: 1.28;
  }

  .work-grid,
  .team-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(17rem, 1fr));
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  .work-card,
  .team-card {
    border: 2px solid var(--about-border);
    padding: 1rem;
    box-shadow: var(--about-shadow);
  }

  .work-card {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.75rem;
  }

  .work-card--yellow {
    background: var(--about-yellow);
  }

  .work-card--red {
    background: var(--about-red);
    color: white;
  }

  .work-card--blue {
    background: var(--about-blue);
    color: white;
  }

  .work-card__kicker,
  .team-card__role {
    font-size: 0.74rem;
    font-weight: 900;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .work-card h3,
  .team-card h3 {
    font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 2.2rem);
    line-height: 0.94;
    font-weight: 900;
    letter-spacing: -0.04em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .work-card p:last-child,
  .team-card p {
    font-size: 0.98rem;
    line-height: 1.2;
  }

  .team-card {
    background: white;
  }

  .team-card a {
    font-weight: 900;
    text-decoration-thickness: 0.08em;
    text-underline-offset: 0.15em;
  }

  .flow > * + * {
    margin-top: 0.95rem;
  }
</style>
